{
  "info": {
    "name": "TalentPipe CRM API",
    "description": "Multi-tenant ATS — schema-per-tenant applicant tracking system.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer JWT in `Authorization` header for all internal endpoints.\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:3000/api\n\n**Variables to set:**\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:3000/api\n- `access_token`: auto-set from login/signup/refresh responses\n- `refresh_token`: auto-set from login/signup/refresh responses\n- `tenant_slug`: your company's unique slug (set manually)\n\nCross-tenant convention: resource exists-but-other-tenant → `404 Not Found` (never 403).\nError shape: `{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\" } }`\n\nRoles: SA = SuperAdmin, OA = Org Admin, R = Recruiter, HM = Hiring Manager, IV = Interviewer",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "talentpipe"
  },
